{"kind":"table","sheets":["Read me","Assumptions","Transactions","Monthly summary","Where the money goes","Subscriptions & flags","Checks"],"sheet":5,"rows":[["Subscriptions, recurring charges and unusual items"],["Section A annualises each recurring merchant; section B lists the standouts. All amounts are live formulas."],[],["A. Recurring charges - merchants charged in at least 4 of the 6 months"],["Merchant","Category","Average charge £","Times charged","Total £","First charge","Last charge","Annualised £","Note"],["STREAMLY SUBSCRIPTION","Subscriptions","10.99","6","65.94","2026-04-03","2026-09-03","131.88","Streaming, monthly from the first month of the period"],["TUNEBOX PREMIUM","Subscriptions","11.99","6","71.94","2026-04-05","2026-09-05","143.88","Music, monthly from the first month"],["CLOUDVAULT STORAGE","Subscriptions","2.99","6","17.94","2026-04-12","2026-09-12","35.88","Cloud storage, monthly from the first month"],["PIXELPLAY GAMES PASS","Subscriptions","14.99","4","59.96","2026-06-20","2026-09-20","179.88","NEW this period - first charge 20 Jun 2026"],["FITLOOP GYM","Fitness","39.00","6","234.00","2026-04-08","2026-09-08","468.00","Gym membership, monthly"],["MOBILEONE","Utilities","18.00","6","108.00","2026-04-18","2026-09-18","216.00","Mobile phone, monthly"],["CITY POWER & GAS","Utilities","65.61","6","393.63","2026-04-15","2026-09-15","787.26","Energy - amount varies with usage"],["All recurring charges","","163.57","40.00","951.41","","","1,962.78"],["of which digital subscriptions (rows 6-9)","","40.96","","215.78","","","491.52"],["Recurring charges per month","","163.57","as % of monthly income:","5.7%"],["Detection rule: same merchant, at least 4 months with a charge. Fitness, phone and energy are included because they behave the same way."],[],["B. Standout items"],["#","Item","Amount £","Why it stands out / what to do"],["1","Biggest single charge outside rent - TECHSHACK, 14 Jul 2026","649.00","One line is 4.7% of six months of spending and it is the reason July is your weakest month apart from September."],["2","Suspected double charge - QUICKBITE DELIVERY, 9 Aug 2026","27.40","The same £27.40 appears twice on the same day for the same merchant. Check the receipt and reclaim if it was billed twice."],["3","Only travel charge - AIRLINE SKYHOP, 2 Sep 2026","312.60","A single lump of £312.60 with no saving in advance; a monthly set-aside would smooth it."],["4","Takeaway & delivery, six months","1,318.44","42 orders, £219.74 a month, and climbing: £91.67 in April to £410.17 in August. The single easiest saving in the file."],["5","Coffee & snacks, six months","231.28","63 charges averaging £3.67 - small each time, the second most frequent spend after transport."],["6","Digital subscriptions, six months","215.78","Now £40.96 a month (£491.52 a year) against £25.97 before 20 Jun 2026, when the games pass started."],["7","Highest energy bill of the period - CITY POWER & GAS, Sep 2026","69.53","£69.53 against a £65.61 average, and the May low of £60.26. Worth checking the tariff or a direct-debit review."],["8","Savings rate, April against September","14.5","In percentage points: 27.2% of income kept in April, 12.7% in September. Shown x100 so the row reads in points."],["9","Duplicate rows found in the export","1","Rows: 9 Aug 2026 QuickBite Delivery £27.40 twice (date, merchant and amount identical). Listed so you can decide, not removed."]],"totalRows":28,"columns":9}